        <updated>2025-12-24T04:21:38.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139863186?u=6f829009eab02b10a701d0746d82a834aad809a5&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This PR clarifies the instructions in the “Printing those products” exercise in the Arrays lesson.</p>
