<p dir="auto">The updated wording makes it clear where the loop should begin and which parts it should encompass, without changing any code logic or solutions.</p>
<p dir="auto">Changes made</p>
<p dir="auto">Updated Step 3 instructions to explicitly state that the for...of() loop wraps Parts 3–6.</p>
<p dir="auto">No code changes; documentation-only clarification.</p>
